# Load testing Experiment

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:experimentwizard, path: "./experimentwizard"}
])
```

## Experiment connection

```elixir
pid1 = Experimentwizard.Master.get_experiment_interface("manager")
experiment_name = "exwiztest"

Experimentwizard.Manager.experiment(pid1, experiment_name)
|> Experimentwizard.Manager.credentials(experiment_name, %{
  certfile: "./creds/cloudlab_decrypted.pem",
  cacertfile: "./creds/emulab-ca.pem"
})
|> Experimentwizard.Manager.profile(experiment_name, "PowderSandbox,Repo-Based_Cluster")
|> Experimentwizard.Manager.project(experiment_name, "utahstud")

# # Start the experiment, or try to connect to the existing experiment.
Experimentwizard.Manager.connect_or_start(pid1, experiment_name)
```

## Yaml specifier

```elixir
yaml = """
is: client-server
requires:
  client: c
  server: s
cells:
    c:
        targets:
            - executer@node1.exwiztest.utahstud.emulab.net
        commands:
            - iperf3 -c 192.168.1.2 -t 10 -J
        output: true
    s:
        targets:
            - executer@node2.exwiztest.utahstud.emulab.net
        commands:
            - iperf3 -s
        synchronous: false
"""
yaml_result = Experimentwizard.RuntimeManager.parse_yaml_string(yaml)
```

```elixir
required_cells = yaml_result.requires
eval_pattern = yaml_result.is
all_cells = yaml_result.cells
```
